<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『アクロマめ▼
きゃつは　かがくしゃ　として
むだに　じゅんすい　すぎる！▼
プラズマだん　としての
すうこうな　しめい　よりも▼
こじんの　きょうみを
ゆうせん　させるとは！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:25:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『アクロマめ▼
きゃつは　科学者として
無駄に　純粋すぎる！▼
プラズマ団の　一員としての
崇高な　使命よりも▼
個人の　興味を
優先させるとは！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:28:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:55:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さてアナタは　こううん　です▼
ワタクシ　ゲーチスの
えんぜつが　きけるのですから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:23:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さてアナタは　幸運です▼
ワタクシ　ゲーチスの
演説が　きけるのですから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:28:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キュレムが　ひめている
ほんとうの　ちからを▼
プラズマだんの
かがくりょく・ぎじゅつりょくで▼
ピークまで　たかめ
イッシュを　こおりづけに　します！▼
きょうふに　しはいされた
イッシュの　たみ　ポケモンは▼
プラズマだんの！▼
いや　ワタクシの！
あしもとに　ふれふすのです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:43:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キュレムが　秘めている
真の　力を▼
プラズマ団の
科学力・技術力で▼
ピークまで　解放し
イッシュを　氷漬けに　します！▼
恐怖に　支配された
イッシュの　民　ポケモンは▼
プラズマ団の！▼
いや　ワタクシの！
足元に　ふれふすのです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:44:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キュレムは　からっぽの　そんざい▼
ある　ポケモンが　レシラムと
ゼクロムに　わかれたときの　あまり……▼
ワタクシの　よくぼうは
イッシュの　かんぜんなる　しはい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T08:43:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キュレムは　虚無▼
ある　ポケモンが　レシラムと
ゼクロムに　分かれたときの　余り……▼
ワタクシの　欲望は
イッシュの　完全なる　支配！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T08:44:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうです！　キュレムという　うつわに
ワタクシの　よくぼうを　そそぐのです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:52:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうです！　キュレムという　器に
ワタクシの　欲望を　注ぐのです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T08:42:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・退場する
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T08:39:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_ninja_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダークトリニティ『……これより
さきには　いかせない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:53:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:04:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダークトリニティ『……これより
先には　行かせない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:58:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:04:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・ゲーチス退場後に登場
・強制でトレーナー戦闘前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T08:39:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NINJA
ダークトリニティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:00:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#408080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_ninja_03_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダークトリニティ『……まあいい▼
おまえに　できるのは
ゲーチスさまが　キュレムを　つかい▼
イッシュを　こおらせる　ようすを
ただ　ながめる……　それだけだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:54:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:04:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダークトリニティ『……まあいい▼
おまえに　できるのは
ゲーチスさまが　キュレムを　使い▼
イッシュを　凍らせる　様子を
ただ　ながめる……　それだけだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:58:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:04:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・トレーナー戦闘前
・外（d10）にでられるうようになる</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:58:46" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NINJA
ダークトリニティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T07:00:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
